### Node / web / mobile / shared ###
node_modules/
dist/
# shared/dist/ is the exception: web's and mobile's deploy builds (Vercel, EAS Build) clone
# a fresh checkout with no local build step for the shared workspace, so @fc27/shared has
# to resolve to something already committed rather than something generated on the fly —
# see shared/src/generated/'s note below for why generating it there isn't practical either
# (needs a JVM for openapi-generator-cli, which most JS-only build images don't have).
!shared/dist/
!shared/dist/**
.expo/
.expo-shared/
coverage/
*.log
logs/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Generated OpenAPI TS client — regenerated via `npm run generate:api` (or `npm test`'s
# pretest) from the checked-in shared/openapi-spec.json. That spec file IS tracked.
shared/src/generated/

# openapi-generator-cli writes its version-pin config to whatever directory it's invoked
# from — shared/openapitools.json (pinned, tracked) is canonical; ignore a stray root copy.
/openapitools.json

### Backend local H2 fallback (h2local profile) ###
backend/.data/

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
